===Hall of Fame===

The IFCB Hall of Fame was established in 1995 to honour individuals who have made significant contributions to the sport of bodybuilding. Inductees include:

* [[Harlan Cooke]] (founder, inaugural inductee, 1995)
* [[Konrad Steiner]] (six-time Mr. Adonia, 1995)
* [[Marcus Crane]] (eight-time Mr. Adonia, 1996)
* [[Eldon Marsh]] (first Mr. Adonia, 1997)
* [[Drago Vălceanu]] (three-time Mr. Adonia, 1998)
* [[Rick Dixon]] (six-time Mr. Adonia, 1999)
* [[Titus Grol]] (eight-time Mr. Adonia, 2006)
* [[Kazuki Hino]] (eight-time Mr. Adonia, 2016)
* [[Satoshi Endo]] (runner-up, rival of Hino, 2018)
* [[Henrik Vossberg]] (former president, statuette sculptor, 2001)

